    "leftFraction": 0.3,
    "pageFraction": 0.34,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 10,
   "tag": "p×2",
   "landmarks": [
    "article",
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 520,
   "text": "My approach so far has been to just do these cleanup operations in small batches\nso that I don’t need to do database queries that take more than 5 seconds to\nrun. This whole experience has given me more of an appreciation for why someone\nmight want to use a “real” database like Postgres which can have more than one\nwriter at the same time though.\nMaybe in the future I’ll just take the site down fo",
