  {
   "index": 12,
   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "article",
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 322,
   "text": "So far I’ve been using Django’s ORM to make any query I want without paying any\nattention at all to query performance and it’s mostly been going okay other\nthan the ANALYZE thing. The database is pretty small (maybe 10000 rows?) and\nI expect it to stay pretty small forever, so I’m hoping that that plan will\nkeep working.",
